{
    "title": "Ball Sort Puz - Color Game",
    "description": "<b>As the most relaxing and addictive color sorting game, this ball sort puzzle is designed to entertain and sharpen your mind simultaneously.</b> While sorting the colored balls to fill each bottle with the same color, the relaxation it brings will relieve stress and distract you from your daily worries.\r\n\r\nThis classic color sorting game is simple to play, but hard to master.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd35 <b>How to play to Ball Sort Puz game</b> \ud83d\udd35\r\n\ud83e\uddea Your goal? Sort balls of the same color into a single bottle!\r\n\ud83e\uddea You can only place balls of the same color together \ud83d\udfe0\ud83d\udfe0\ud83d\udfe0\ud83d\udfe0\r\n\ud83e\uddeaTap any bottle to pick up the top ball, then tap another bottle to move the ball into it.\r\n\ud83e\uddea Choose your moves wisely! You win the level when all the bottles contain only ONE color balls\r\n\ud83e\uddea Use \u201cundo\u201d and add an extra bottle if you get stuck\r\n\ud83e\uddea Level up & earn coins to power up and defeat the most challenging levels \ud83d\udcaa There are thousands of difficult puzzles.\r\n\r\nThis Ball Sort game is the best puzzle game to exercise your brain and train your logical thinking. How many bottles would you be able to sort?\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udfe2 <b>Ball Sort Unique Features</b> \ud83d\udfe2\r\n\ud83c\udd93 FREE color sorting game\r\n\ud83e\udd29 One-finger control, tap on the bottle to sort the ball\r\n\ud83e\udd73 Thousands of levels to challenge, varying difficulty & infinite joy\r\n\u23f3 NO TIMER, enjoy the Ball Sort puzzles at your own pace\r\n\u23ef NO penalties, you can restart your current level at any time\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Train your brain with relaxing games\r\n\ud83d\udd79 Simple but addictive gameplay\r\n\ud83d\udcf6 Play offline! No Wi-Fi needed\r\n\u2615\ufe0f Family Game, suitable for all ages\r\n\r\nThis challenging yet relaxing <b>Ball Sort</b> puzzle game will never get you bored when playing color sort games. Share this brain training game with your family and fiends and enjoy a full day of entertaining and relaxing time sorting colors.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd34\ud83d\udfe2\ud83d\udfe1 Ready to add a splash of color to your life \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udfe3\ud83d\udfe0 and let your puzzle skills shine with the better ball color sort game 2023? Download this free puzzle app to play <b>Ball Sort </b>on Android and become the ultimate master of color sort games!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>As the most relaxing and addictive color sorting game, this ball sort puzzle is designed to entertain and sharpen your mind simultaneously.</b> While sorting the colored balls to fill each bottle with the same color, the relaxation it brings will relieve stress and distract you from your daily worries.<br><br>This classic color sorting game is simple to play, but hard to master.<br><br>\ud83d\udd35 <b>How to play to Ball Sort Puz game</b> \ud83d\udd35<br>\ud83e\uddea Your goal? Sort balls of the same color into a single bottle!<br>\ud83e\uddea You can only place balls of the same color together \ud83d\udfe0\ud83d\udfe0\ud83d\udfe0\ud83d\udfe0<br>\ud83e\uddeaTap any bottle to pick up the top ball, then tap another bottle to move the ball into it.<br>\ud83e\uddea Choose your moves wisely! You win the level when all the bottles contain only ONE color balls<br>\ud83e\uddea Use \u201cundo\u201d and add an extra bottle if you get stuck<br>\ud83e\uddea Level up &amp; earn coins to power up and defeat the most challenging levels \ud83d\udcaa There are thousands of difficult puzzles.<br><br>This Ball Sort game is the best puzzle game to exercise your brain and train your logical thinking. How many bottles would you be able to sort?<br><br>\ud83d\udfe2 <b>Ball Sort Unique Features</b> \ud83d\udfe2<br>\ud83c\udd93 FREE color sorting game<br>\ud83e\udd29 One-finger control, tap on the bottle to sort the ball<br>\ud83e\udd73 Thousands of levels to challenge, varying difficulty &amp; infinite joy<br>\u23f3 NO TIMER, enjoy the Ball Sort puzzles at your own pace<br>\u23ef NO penalties, you can restart your current level at any time<br>\ud83e\udde0 Train your brain with relaxing games<br>\ud83d\udd79 Simple but addictive gameplay<br>\ud83d\udcf6 Play offline! No Wi-Fi needed<br>\u2615\ufe0f Family Game, suitable for all ages<br><br>This challenging yet relaxing <b>Ball Sort</b> puzzle game will never get you bored when playing color sort games. Share this brain training game with your family and fiends and enjoy a full day of entertaining and relaxing time sorting colors.<br><br>\ud83d\udd34\ud83d\udfe2\ud83d\udfe1 Ready to add a splash of color to your life \ud83d\udd35\ud83d\udfe3\ud83d\udfe0 and let your puzzle skills shine with the better ball color sort game 2023? Download this free puzzle app to play <b>Ball Sort </b>on Android and become the ultimate master of color sort games!",
